g: 16. Then, 25% of the remaining (not 25% of total) is 25% of 16 = 4 students in jazz. Rest enrolled in hip-hop: 16 - 4 = 12 students. 12 / 20 = 0.6 => 60%. So 60% is the correct answer. Alternatively, if the question was meant to say that 25% of the total students are in jazz, then it would be different, but based on the wording, it's 25% of the remaining after contemporary. So, the answer is 60%. 

