   $$

4. **Cost per Carton**: Each carton costs $4.00.

5. **Total Cost**: Multiply the number of cartons by the cost per carton.
   $$
   4 \text{ cartons} \times \$4.00/\text{carton} = \$16.00
   $$

So, the total amount Cynthia spends on ice cream after 60 days is $\boxed{16}$. 16.00

