   $$
   60 \div 4 = 15 \text{ sets}
   $$

3. **Total cost**: Each set of 4 yogurts costs $5.00, so the cost for 15 sets is:
   $$
   15 \times 5 = 75
   $$

Therefore, the total cost for Terry to buy 60 yogurts over 30 days is $\boxed{75}$. \boxed{75}
